              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10689' id='24' type-v2='text' w='92431' x='3781' y='85833'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Created By: Javad Eldarli</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>Please direct all inquiries to the People Analytics JIRA</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run auto-url='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4996b2' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://jira.deliveryhero.com/plugins/servlet/desk/portal/53&amp;quot;' underline='true'>https://jira.deliveryhero.com/plugins/servlet/desk/portal/53</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='7331' id='29' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Untitled design (11).png' type-v2='bitmap' w='5571' x='571' y='667'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
                  <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
                  <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#272d36' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='7331' id='30' type-v2='empty' w='8643' x='6142' y='667'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
                  <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
                  <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#272d36' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='32750' id='79' type-v2='text' w='59433' x='3781' y='32167'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='14'>Data Model</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Our data model for detecting employees with a Job Profile that needs review is based on three foundational pillars:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#72b966' fontsize='10'>String Matching:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This technique detects common words between Job Profile and Business Title. It is a straightforward method that looks for direct matches or overlaps in terminology.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#72b966' fontsize='10'>Data Science Model:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Utilizing Natural Language Processing (NLP), this model identifies cases where Job Profile and Business Title are semantically similar, even if there are no common words. This allows for detection of contextual similarities, improving the robustness of our quality assessment.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#72b966' fontsize='10'>Word Mapping:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Combinations of word(s) in the Business Title and word(s) in the /Job Profile, that are deemed to go or not go together. This approach instructs common accurate or inaccurate pairings based on historical data and expert inputs.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This step overrules the previous two.
</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>The mapping will be continuously updated thanks to the inputs provided by the brands when assessing employees&apos; Job Profile data quality.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='18835' id='80' type-v2='text' w='92431' x='3781' y='10665'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='14'>Introduction</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Welcome to the Job Catalog Utilization and Data Quality Dashboard. This dashboard helps you to:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Monitor the usage of the Job Profiles in the organization</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Monitor and improve the accuracy of employees&apos; job profiles in the organization.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This instruction page is meant to ensure you understand the components of the dashboard, the methodology behind the data model, and how to effectively use the dashboard to foster continuous improvement in Job Catalog and its usage.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#da040a' fontsize='11'>Note: Achieving 100% data accuracy on employees&apos; Job Profiles is not the goal, as the data model is a quantitative analysis tool that compares employee&apos;s Business Title and Job Profile, hence won&apos;t be able to capture those cases where a more in-depth job matching needs to be carried out</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='2667' id='81' type-v2='empty' w='92431' x='3781' y='29500'>
